### Full health check
GET {{Dispatch.Server.Host}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### Server-only liveness check
GET {{Dispatch.Server.Host}}/alive
Accept: text/plain

### Front-end service status check
GET {{Dispatch.Server.Host}}/ready
Accept: text/plain

### Create handler
POST {{Dispatch.Server.Host}}/handlers
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="echo.wasm"

< ./Artifacts/echo.wasm
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Echo
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

A handler that echoes the request headers and body sent to it.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="slug"

--boundary-- 

### Get handlers
GET {{Dispatch.Server.Host}}/handlers
Accept: application/json 

### Get handler
< {% request.variables.set("id", "01a10631-8c25-7408-bc5f-e78292a64b47") %}
GET {{Dispatch.Server.Host}}/handlers/{{id}}
Accept: application/json